WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:03.603
Welcome to Gates Hillman Center
known to students simply as Gates.

2
00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:07.340
This is the first standalone school
for computer science in the United States.

3
00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.910
Many other institutions have computer
science as part of their engineering

4
00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:14.080
or science school,
but CMU has its own school dedicated

5
00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:17.851
just for CS, which is part of the reason
why we're so good at it.

6
00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:20.320
The CS curriculum here
is really impressive,

7
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.022
and for many of the classes you take here,

8
00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:23.523
your professor has literally written the textbook,

9
00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:26.760
like for the Introductory
Computer Systems class here.

10
00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:31.097
SCS offers five main majors
and they are Artificial Intelligence,

11
00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:32.565
Human Computer Interaction,

12
00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:36.302
Computational Biology,
General Computer Science and Robotics.

13
00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:38.238
We have over 300 faculty

14
00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:41.608
and they collaborate across colleges
to work on research projects.

15
00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:43.877
There are three ways to get involved here

16
00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:48.877
through the Office of Undergraduate
Research and Scholarly Development for undergraduates.

17
00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:52.719
One of the programs is called
the Summer Undergraduate Research Fellowship,

18
00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:53.987
and this is funded.

19
00:00:53.987 --> 00:00:56.890
and for students who take part
in, obviously over the summer.

20
00:00:56.890 --> 00:01:01.394
Another unfunded counterpart to that is
the Summer Undergraduate Research Apprenticeship

21
00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:03.329
which you can do for course credit.

22
00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:04.464
We have another program

23
00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:07.634
called the Highway to Undergraduate
Research in the academic year,

24
00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:08.968
also known as HURAY.

25
00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:12.105
Ways to get involved in
these programs are pretty simple.

26
00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:14.641
You reach out to faculty of your choice,

27
00:01:14.808 --> 00:01:18.578
propose your research project,
then you submit that for approval.

28
00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:22.482
Scholars here have been nationally recognized with awards
like the Fulbright Award

29
00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:26.086
and we have 21 Nobel Prize winners
that are connected to CMU.

